// @probe reject: `file_read` is gone
// The retirement gate looked only at the name of the call it was inspecting. A retired builtin
// used as the *receiver* of a chain went straight past it, because `len` answers from the
// collection's shape without ever inferring what produced it. `file_read(p).len()` type-checked,
// and so did every other retired name written that way — the gate was missing for all of them.
agent Main {
    public void Run() {
        print file_read("notes.txt").len();
    }
}
